         <pb/>
         <div type="div1">
            <head>PREFACE</head>
            <p>In his last letter to me Caldecott wrote: 'I have been making several attempts at the Giant, and have been cogitating over the Illustrations to "Jack" generally. During the winter I shall be able to show you some of my ideas.' The following unfinished Sketches are the 'ideas,' which, with Mrs. Caldecott's kind permission, have been reproduced.</p>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>H. T.</head>
               <div type="div3">
                  <head>To My Father,<lb/>
                     <lb/>In Recognition Of What This Booklet Owes To Him,<lb/>
                     <lb/>And To My Nephews,<lb/>
                     <lb/>'Golden-Hair'd' Ally, Charlie, And Michael,<lb/>
                     <lb/>Who Have So Far Condescended<lb/>
                     <lb/>As To Honour It With Their Approbation.</head>
               </div>
            </div>
         </div>
